5,1,1,talk,Jonathan,,I think we should be careful about the long-term financial viability. I'll look into this year's development allocation in the ledger and the regional fund tariffs by contact location.,"{""words"":29,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Shion,,I want to see if previous efforts actually worked. I'll check the readmission figures during the call-back trial and the visit completion on the shared nursing round.,"{""words"":27,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Midori,,"I'm concerned about the pressure on our staff. I will look into the ward nursing vacancies and agency cover, as well as the therapy and midwifery staffing review.","{""words"":28,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Kenji,,"I want to make sure we have the space and tools to actually do this! I'll check rooms, parking and shuttle coverage, and what the booking system records.","{""words"":28,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Shizue,,I want to ensure our partnerships are sustainable. I will look into the board minutes on a jointly run clinic and the data agreements with outside surgeries.,"{""words"":27,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
